OL,3,GNEWSAPsychiatric patient killer not
OL,4,Adeemed violent, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with paranoid schizophrenia who
OL,7,Fkilled a fellow patient was not given a
OL,8,Fspecific care plan assessing his risk
OL,9,Fof violence, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FAhsan Zia punched, kicked and stamped
OL,12,Fon Michael Matthews, 55, at the Hadrian
OL,13,FClinic in Newcastle in April 2022.
OL,15,FThe 33-year-old suffered with delusions
OL,16,Fabout a plot to rape and kill him and
OL,17,Fwas given an indefinite hospital order
OL,18,Fafter admitting manslaughter in 2023.
